  "hardBoundaries": [
    "The eleven profiles are article-reported source-local clusters, not eleven canonical or adult spinal interneuron types.",
    "The bare public GEO matrix does not contain cluster, Type I or Type II, cervical or lumbar annotation columns, so exact barcode mappings are unavailable.",
    "Article Figure 6 cluster counts sum to 949, but the project cannot independently reproduce cluster membership from the count matrix without the source assignment map.",
